<figure id="S5.F6" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2603.11382v1/fig10_hidden_dim_sweep.svg" id="S5.F6.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:362/173;" width="362" height="173"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S5.F6.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 6</span>: </span><span id="S5.F6.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Entanglement gap <math id="S5.F6.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta</annotation></semantics></math> as a function of hidden dimensionality
<math id="S5.F6.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n_{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n_{h}</annotation></semantics></math>. Exact density matrix for <math id="S5.F6.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n_{h}\leq 10" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n_{h}\leq 10</annotation></semantics></math>; mean-field approximation for
<math id="S5.F6.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n_{h}&gt;10" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n_{h}&gt;10</annotation></semantics></math>. The mean-field approximation collapses the entanglement signal,
indicating that exact density-matrix computation is necessary for detection.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="S5.T8" class="ltx_table">

