Right: <math id="S5.T8.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta</annotation></semantics></math> for non-Markovian agents with memory length <math id="S5.T8.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></figcaption><div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
