<section id="Ax1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix">Appendix</h2>

</section>
<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Metric Definitions</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Entanglement Entropy (<math id="A1.SS1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{\mathrm{ent}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>ent</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{\mathrm{ent}}</annotation></semantics></math>)</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Given density matrix <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rho" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ρ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rho</annotation></semantics></math> over hidden units, partition into subsystems <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>A</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A</annotation></semantics></math>
(units <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1,\ldots,\lfloor n_{h}/2\rfloor" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⌊</mo><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⌋</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1,\ldots,\lfloor n_{h}/2\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math>) and <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>B</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B</annotation></semantics></math> (remaining units):</p>
<table id="A1.Ex8" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rho_{A}=\mathrm{Tr}_{B}(\rho),\quad S_{\mathrm{ent}}=-\mathrm{Tr}(\rho_{A}\log\rho_{A})." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Tr</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>ent</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>Tr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rho_{A}=\mathrm{Tr}_{B}(\rho),\quad S_{\mathrm{ent}}=-\mathrm{Tr}(\rho_{A}\log\rho_{A}).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.2" class="ltx_p">LRF <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\in[0,1]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\in[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math> is the overlap between dominant eigenspaces of consecutive windows.
EPS = mean LRF across windows. PRI = EPS stability under <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>σ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma</annotation></semantics></math>-level noise.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2 </span>Counterfactual Divergence (CD) and ARS</h3>

<div id="A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Given original trajectory <math id="A1.SS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>τ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau</annotation></semantics></math> and counterfactual <math id="A1.SS2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau_{cf}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau_{cf}</annotation></semantics></math> (generated by
adversarial environment modification), ARS measures the ratio of latent entropy
change. Pre-event restructuring is computed over a fixed pre-perturbation
analysis window before the perturbation event.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Hyperparameters</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">All experiments use seed <math id="A2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="=42" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mn>42</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">=42</annotation></semantics></math>. QBM: <math id="A2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n_{v}=7" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n_{v}=7</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n_{h}=8" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n_{h}=8</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Gamma=0.5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Gamma=0.5</annotation></semantics></math>,
<math id="A2.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta=1.0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta=1.0</annotation></semantics></math>, lr <math id="A2.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="=0.01" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mn>0.01</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">=0.01</annotation></semantics></math>, CD steps <math id="A2.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">=1</annotation></semantics></math>, epochs <math id="A2.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="=50" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">=50</annotation></semantics></math> (main),
epochs <math id="A2.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="=30" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">=30</annotation></semantics></math> (sweep), batch <math id="A2.p1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="=32" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">=32</annotation></semantics></math>. Dataset: <math id="A2.p1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n=30" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n=30</annotation></semantics></math> per class, <math id="A2.p1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T=100" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T=100</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<section id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Frozen Phase I gate thresholds.</h4>

<div id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau_{\mathrm{ent}}=1.9657" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>ent</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1.9657</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau_{\mathrm{ent}}=1.9657</annotation></semantics></math> (entanglement entropy),
<math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau_{\mathrm{mi}}=0.3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>mi</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau_{\mathrm{mi}}=0.3</annotation></semantics></math> (mutual information),
<math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau_{\mathrm{eps}}=0.6507" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>eps</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.6507</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau_{\mathrm{eps}}=0.6507</annotation></semantics></math> (eigenmode persistence),
<math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau_{\mathrm{pri}}=0.9860" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>pri</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.9860</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau_{\mathrm{pri}}=0.9860</annotation></semantics></math> (perturbation resilience).
CD and ARS are reported in this preprint as diagnostic counterfactual metrics
rather than as frozen quantitative classification thresholds.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Confound-rejection thresholds (calibrated from Phase I).</h4>

<div id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau_{\mathrm{spi}}=0.28" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>spi</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.28</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau_{\mathrm{spi}}=0.28</annotation></semantics></math> (spectral periodicity, upper-bound),
<math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau_{\mathrm{acm}}=0.24" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>acm</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau_{\mathrm{acm}}=0.24</annotation></semantics></math> (autocorrelation, upper-bound).</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Reproducibility Notes</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">All results are reproducible with <span class="ltx_ref ltx_nolink ltx_path ltx_font_typewriter ltx_ref_self">seed=42</span> throughout. The
<span class="ltx_ref ltx_nolink ltx_path ltx_font_typewriter ltx_ref_self">_compute_pri</span> function calls <span class="ltx_ref ltx_nolink ltx_path ltx_font_typewriter ltx_ref_self">np.random.randn</span> via the global
NumPy state; notebooks set <span class="ltx_ref ltx_nolink ltx_path ltx_font_typewriter ltx_ref_self">np.random.seed(42)</span> before each
<span class="ltx_ref ltx_nolink ltx_path ltx_font_typewriter ltx_ref_self">analyze_batch()</span> call.</p>
</div>
</section><div class="ltx_rdf" about="" property="dcterms:creator" content="Christopher Altman"></div>
<div class="ltx_rdf" about="" property="dcterms:subject" content="UCIP; continuation interest; continuation structure; self-preservation; autonomous agents; AI alignment; agency detection; persistence detection; baseline-relative detection; mutual information; counterfactual divergence; entanglement entropy; spectral periodicity index; autocorrelation metric; SPI; ACM; Quantum Boltzmann Machine; QBM encoder; transformer activations; stochastic reference models"></div>
<div class="ltx_rdf" about="" property="dcterms:subject" content="Operational detection of continuation-interest structure and persistence signatures in autonomous sequential agents using the Unified Continuation-Interest Protocol (UCIP)."></div>
<div class="ltx_rdf" about="" property="dcterms:title" content="Detecting Intrinsic and Instrumental Self-Preservation in Autonomous Agents: The Unified Continuation-Interest Protocol"></div>

</article>
</div>
</div>
